sequenceDiagram
  participant Sender
  participant Odoo as Odoo HTTP
  participant Endpoint as Inbound Endpoint
  participant Event as Inbound Event
  participant Handler as Webhook Handler
  participant Queue as Queue Job

  Sender->>Odoo: POST /webhook/path
  Odoo->>Endpoint: Resolve endpoint + config
  Endpoint->>Endpoint: Verify signature + timestamp
  Endpoint->>Event: Create event record
  Event->>Handler: Evaluate rules
  Handler->>Queue: Enqueue action job
  Queue->>Handler: Execute action
  Handler->>Event: Update state + audit
  Odoo-->>Sender: 2xx / 4xx response
